sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant VendorOrder as VendorOrder
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+VendorOrder: confirm()
    Note over VendorOrder: Policies: vendorOrderRead, vendorOrderWrite, vendorOrderExecute
    Note over VendorOrder: Guards (3)
    VendorOrder->>VendorOrder: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;submitted#quot;
    VendorOrder->>VendorOrder: guard[1]: self.submittedAt != null
    VendorOrder->>VendorOrder: guard[2]: self.deletedAt == null
    VendorOrder->>VendorOrder: compute.previousStatus
    VendorOrder->>VendorOrder: mutate.status
    VendorOrder->>VendorOrder: mutate.confirmedAt
    VendorOrder->>EventBus: emit VendorOrderConfirmed on vendor_order.confirmed
    VendorOrder-->>-Client: void